(Finding 4: Auditor self-assessment.) Tj T*
(In the interest of full disclosure: the auditor's dance record before this quarter is) Tj T*
(one dance-off, at the 2019 holiday party, result not recorded. Footwork modifier +0.) Tj T*
(Recommended remediation: practice, after the close.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Finding 5: Known control weakness.) Tj T*
(The auditor loses the tempo when anyone asks about their weekend. The auditor has) Tj T*
(documented this weakness and has not yet remediated it. The weekend was very nice.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Management response) Tj T*
(The party leader disputes Finding 2 and requests a recount with fewer arms involved.) Tj T*
(Sergeant Cordula Vance accepts Findings 1 and 3, and has added the tide table to her) Tj T*
(pre-dance checklist.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Opinion) Tj T*
(The party's records present fairly, in all material respects, a group that dances) Tj T*
(better than it keeps books. Audit status: closed, pending the next quarter.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Signed, the Quarterly Close Accountant) Tj T*
